# Security

User-supplied or rich-text HTML must be sanitized with `src/utils/xss.ts` before render.

- Do not use `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` without passing content through the xss utility
- When adding new HTML rendering paths, add or extend tests in `src/utils/xss.test.ts`
